# Deterministic line endings.
#
# The repository is developed on Windows where core.autocrlf may be enabled.
# Prettier and rustfmt are configured for LF, so the working tree MUST be LF
# regardless of the contributor's git configuration, otherwise `format:check`
# and `cargo fmt --check` are not reproducible in a clean clone (G0 §27).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be normalised.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary

# Lockfiles are generated; keep diffs collapsed in review UIs.
pnpm-lock.yaml linguist-generated=true -diff
Cargo.lock     linguist-generated=true -diff
